<section xmlns="http://xml.house.gov/schemas/uslm/1.0" style="-uslm-lc:I80" id="id0bdc3f4d-810c-11f1-b7ce-bdea3d14cbdd" identifier="/us/usc/t16/s450rr–2"><num value="450rr–2">§ 450rr–2.</num><heading> Commendation</heading><content>
<p style="-uslm-lc:I11" class="indent0">The Congress of the United States highly commends the members of the joint international expedition which discovered the R.M.S. Titanic.</p>
</content><sourceCredit id="id0bdc3f4e-810c-11f1-b7ce-bdea3d14cbdd">(<ref href="/us/pl/99/513/s4">Pub. L. 99–513, § 4</ref>, <date date="1986-10-21">Oct. 21, 1986</date>, <ref href="/us/stat/100/2083">100 Stat. 2083</ref>.)</sourceCredit>
</section>
